        "title": "Let değişkenlerini güncelleme",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>const</code> değişkenlerinin aksine, <code>let</code> değişkenlerinin tuttukları değerleri değiştirebildiğini ve güncelleyebildiğini zaten gördük.</p><p><code>=</code> işaretini kullanarak <code>playerState</code> içindeki değeri <code>\"Idle\"</code> durumundan <code>\"Running\"</code> durumuna değiştir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>let</code> değişkenlerini istediğimiz kadar sık güncelleyebiliriz.</p><p>Kendin dene: <code>playerState</code> değerini <code>\"Jumping\"</code> olarak değiştir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jumping&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerState</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Jumping\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkeni diğerine eşitleyerek değişkenlere başka değişkenlerin değerlerini de verebiliriz.</p><p><code>playerState</code> değişkenine <code>defaultState</code> değerini ver.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = defaultState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>defaultState</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkeni güncellediğimizde, önceki değerini unutur.</p><p><code>playerState</code> değişkeni <code>\"Attacking\"</code> olarak ayarlandığında ve <code>\"Defending\"</code> olarak ayarlandığında görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacking&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerState</code>, ardından <code>playerState</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod satırlarından hangisi <code>playerHealth</code> değişkenini günceller?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let playerHealth = 50;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Forest</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İlk satırda <code>let</code> anahtar kelimesi eksik</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İlk satırda <code>let</code> anahtar kelimesi eksik.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
