            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>gameState</code> değişkenini <code>\"Paused\"</code> olarak güncelle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let gameState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>gameState</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve sonra <code>\"Paused\"</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
