      {
        "id": 17159,
        "title": "Dize İfadeleri",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dize değerlerini <code>+</code> işaretiyle birbirine ekleyebiliriz.</p><p><code>\"Score:\"</code> ve <code>\"55\"</code> değerlerini birlikte ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metin değerlerini bir araya getirmeye <strong>ifade</strong> deriz, çünkü bu işlem tek bir metin değeri oluşturur.</p><p><code>console.log()</code> parantezlerinin arasına ifadeyi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Score:\"</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>\"55\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İfadeler değişkenler içerdiğinde, değişkenlerdeki değerleri kullanırlar.</p><p><code>\"HP:\"</code> değerini ve <code>playerHealth</code> değişkenini birlikte ekleyen bir ifade oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerHealth;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"HP:\"</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve son olarak <code>playerHealth</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İfadelerin sonuçlarını görmek için <code>console.log()</code> kullanabiliriz.</p><p>İfadenin çevresine bir <code>console.log()</code> talimatı ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console.log</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İfadeler değerlere dönüştüğü için onları tıpkı değerler gibi değişkenlere verebiliriz.</p><p><code>\"Level:\" + \"13\"</code> ifadesini <code>label</code> değişkeninde sakla ve konsolda görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Level:\"</code>, ardından <code>+</code> ve sonra <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>label</code>'ın değeri nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Player:Rex\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Rex\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Player:Rex\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145181,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Hiçbir şey, çünkü <code>console.log()</code> talimatı yok</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>GameOver</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hiçbir şey, çünkü <code>console.log()</code> talimatı yok.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemyName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy:slime</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy:slime</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
