            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda <code>Score:55</code> görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>console.log</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>\"Score:\" + \"55\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
